        { "text": "$-\\frac{2}{x - 2} + \\frac{2}{x + 4}$", "why": "Assigned the signs to the wrong factors." },
        { "text": "$\\frac{6}{x - 2} - \\frac{6}{x + 4}$", "why": "Split $12$ into $6$ and $6$ without dividing by the factor gap." }
